                "pos": "num",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ebf602e-00f7-3af4-92d0-f2165a8f7c50",
                        "entry_id": "331a605e-d133-3554-9834-bb06ff16c2cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Eighty."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1266d60-57b3-4a0c-b005-ce487e38cacd",
                                "sense_id": "1ebf602e-00f7-3af4-92d0-f2165a8f7c50",
                                "text": "Thou ſtick'ſt a dagger in me, I ſhall neuer ſee my gold againe, foureſcore ducats at aſitting, foureſcore ducats."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "450260a2-6ae7-4827-8f8c-1f2568a25cd1",
                                "sense_id": "1ebf602e-00f7-3af4-92d0-f2165a8f7c50",
                                "text": "Euen thoſe that were numbꝛed of them, were eight thouſand, and fiue hundꝛed, and foureſcoꝛe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a02c42f4-5953-4a4d-b167-2f120cddf936",
                                "sense_id": "1ebf602e-00f7-3af4-92d0-f2165a8f7c50",
                                "text": "“I could be sorry for these men,” he said, “ay, and for that poor Queen, but what avail earthly sorrows to a man of fourscore?—and it is a rare dropping morning for the early colewort.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4f52bc6-0f23-4803-a912-afb8f677ac3d",
                                "sense_id": "1ebf602e-00f7-3af4-92d0-f2165a8f7c50",
                                "text": "Four score and seven years ago our fathers brought forth, on this continent, a new nation, conceived in Liberty, and dedicated to the proposition that all men are created equal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b142f41e-e92a-44bf-b917-bd7cef39a2b2",
                                "sense_id": "1ebf602e-00f7-3af4-92d0-f2165a8f7c50",
                                "text": "Old Martha was standing at a table trussing a pair of chickens for the market stall as she had trussed them for nearly fourscore years."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f646e34-108b-3d5c-b9c3-b78ea5c862d2",
                        "entry_id": "331a605e-d133-3554-9834-bb06ff16c2cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A full-length life, reckoned as eighty years."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "idiomatic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d147498-21bb-4177-9da7-866a72b32c11",
                                "sense_id": "3f646e34-108b-3d5c-b9c3-b78ea5c862d2",
                                "text": "[…] I know every life is equally sacred, but that is a thought, another thought, I mean, all these valuable people who aren’t going to have their normal fourscore as it is now, these people aren’t going to be replaced, and it’s such a loss to the culture."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
